{
  "$comment": "A session report's body as a Plate value (rpg-ai A24). The title is the journal's name and never appears in the body. A plain-text body becomes one paragraph per blank-line-separated block (trimmed; a block's own line breaks kept; empty blocks dropped); a Plate value is kept as it is. Mentions, when there are any, close the body with one paragraph: \"Mentioned: \" then each mention node (target_entity_type, target_entity_id, the entity's name as its text), separated by \", \", empty text leaves around inline nodes as Slate requires. Held on the server (server/extensions/wiki_shared/Report.py) and the lite edition (client/src/lib/report.ts).",
